=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-28T12:23:32Z","updated_at":"2026-07-28T12:41:17Z","body":"Reproducible on M4 Pro Mac (macOS 26.6), trace:\n```\nLocalVector<RendererRD::SkyRD::ReflectionData::DownsampleLayer::Mipmap, unsigned int, false, false>::operator[](unsigned int) (core/templates/local_vector.h:212)\nRendererRD::SkyRD::ReflectionData::create_reflection_importance_sample(bool, int, unsigned int) (servers/rendering/renderer_rd/environment/sky.cpp:465)\nRendererRD::LightStorage::reflection_probe_instance_postprocess_step(RID) (servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/light_storage.cpp:1871)\nRendererSceneCull::_render_reflection_probe_step(RendererSceneCull::Instance*, int) (servers/rendering/renderer_scene_cull.cpp:3852)\nRendererSceneCull::render_probes() (servers/rendering/renderer_scene_cull.cpp:3879)\nRenderingServerDefault::_draw(bool, double) (servers/rendering/rendering_server_default.cpp:106)\nRenderingServerDefault::draw(bool, double) (servers/rendering/rendering_server_default.cpp:451)\nMain::iteration() (main/main.cpp:4985)\ninvocation function for block in OS_MacOS_NSApp::start_main() (platform/macos/os_macos.mm:1117)\n__CFRUNLOOP_IS_CALLING_OUT_TO_AN_OBSERVER_CALLBACK_FUNCTION__ (@__CFRUNLOOP_IS_CALLING_OUT_TO_AN_OBSERVER_CALLBACK_FUNCTION__:12)\n__CFRunLoopDoObservers (@__CFRunLoopDoObservers:165)\n__CFRunLoopRun (@__CFRunLoopRun:234)\n_CFRunLoopRunSpecificWithOptions (@_CFRunLoopRunSpecificWithOptions:136)\nRunCurrentEventLoopInMode (@RunCurrentEventLoopInMode:83)\nReceiveNextEventCommon (@ReceiveNextEventCommon:125)\n_BlockUntilNextEventMatchingListInMode (@_BlockUntilNextEventMatchingListInMode:15)\n_DPSBlockUntilNextEventMatchingListInMode (@_DPSBlockUntilNextEventMatchingListInMode:60)\n_DPSNextEvent (@_DPSNextEvent:147)\n-[NSApplication(NSEventRouting) _nextEventMatchingEventMask:untilDate:inMode:dequeue:] (@-[NSApplication(NSEventRouting) _nextEventMatchingEventMask:untilDate:inMode:dequeue:]:175)\n-[NSApplication(NSEventRouting) nextEventMatchingMask:untilDate:inMode:dequeue:] (@-[NSApplication(NSEventRouting) nextEventMatchingMask:untilDate:inMode:dequeue:]:21)\n-[NSApplication run] (@-[NSApplication run]:95)\nOS_MacOS_NSApp::run() (platform/macos/os_macos.mm:1068)\nmain (platform/macos/godot_main_macos.mm:132)\nstart (@start:1751)\n```\n\nCrashes on accessing `downsampled_layer.mipmaps[0]` which is empty. Adding a simple range check fixes the crash, but unlikely is a correct fix.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5104093921/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5151910560","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120474#issuecomment-5151910560","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120474","id":5151910560,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMxPqoA","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/use